   [#675](https://github.com/hynek/structlog/pull/675)
 
+- `structlog.processors.ExceptionRenderer` (and thus `structlog.processors.format_exc_info` and `structlog.processors.dict_tracebacks`) don't add an `exception` key anymore if there is no exception to render (e.g. when `log.exception()` is called outside of an exception handler).
+  Previously, `"MISSING"` respectively `[]` was rendered.
+
+  [#676](https://github.com/hynek/structlog/issues/676)
+
 
